  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified OAI 980 days before the posting",
  "headline_cites": ["D4"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 985599 at Baxter Healthcare Corporation (FEI 2618677) ended on 2016-10-03 and was classified OAI, 980 days before FDA posted the potassium chloride shortage on 2019-06-10.",
      "cites": ["D4", "E59"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Additional OAI inspections at the same plant occurred on 2010-08-26, 2013-04-19, 2014-02-11, and 2015-05-01, with corresponding warning letters issued on 2011-01-20 and 2013-05-31.",
      "cites": ["E51", "E54", "E56", "E58", "E62", "E63"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A later OAI inspection at Baxter Healthcare Corporation (FEI 1416980) ended on 2024-08-01, and another ended on 2026-04-02, with a warning letter issued on 2026-09-29.",
      "cites": ["E39", "E41", "E42"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Pfizer Healthcare India Private Limited (FEI 3008316085) received an OAI classification on 2019-09-06, 88 days after the shortage posting, and a warning letter on 2020-03-25.",
      "cites": ["D16", "E84", "E86"]
    },
    {
      "text": "As of 2026-10-21 the shortage has been on FDA's list for 88 months.",
      "cites": ["D27"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule-selected alternate manufacturer is A-S Medication Solutions, which is not on FDA's shortage list today and its label names no plant we could place.",
      "cites": ["D24"]
    }
  ]
}
